    <h5>Visualization Literacy and Pedagogy&lt;/h4&gt;

In addition to being the one of the primary organizers of the first workshop on the <a href="https://vgl.cs.usfca.edu/pdvw/2016/">Pedagogy of Data Visualization</a> at IEEE VIS 2016, our group has also explored novel ways to teach visualization in the classroom. 
